From 74b7ba19a1969156d35ae819be36609e242126ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:41:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 902/913] core: pta: secstor_ta: check against REE FS TA
 downgrade

Bootstrap TAs that can be installed in secure storage, can also be run
from REE FS. REE FS maintains a rollback version check in "ta_ver.db"
for each run TA. Add a check in the secure storage PTA against the same
file to make sure that installed TAs aren't a downgrade from what has
previously been run from REE FS.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 84d0a59c2e2443c7acf4023c13607a0ea30872e5 core: pta: secstor_ta: check against REE FS TA downgrade]
Fixes: 30668b28176c ("core: add management pseudo TA for secstor TAs")
